        <mxCell id="notes" value="No Istio gateway, mesh, CNPG operator, VSO or telemetry workloads are installed by these manifests.&lt;br&gt;Vault is a pipeline dependency, not a per-request backend hop. Frontend → backend has no application TLS.&lt;br&gt;Detailed source paths, service behavior and bootstrap ordering: backend-k3s.md." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontColor=#334155;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
